{"schema":"LAW_EN_DOCUMENT_V1","id":"i18n-5cb21a225781ab2729ab70147dd922a381cbfcf402c6dc85","family_id":"KR:013220","country":"KR","language":"en","title":"ENFORCEMENT DECREE OF THE ACT ON MANAGEMENT OF FIREFIGHTING EQUIPMENT","title_original":"소방장비관리법 시행령","kind":"대통령령","source_version":"287377","promulgated":null,"effective":null,"translation_status":"AI_DRAFT","body_status":"BODY_LOADED","source_url":"https://www.law.go.kr/LSW/lsInfoP.do?lsiSeq=287377","source_sha256":"5ec8ed6d9986beb9b06e27df3fdfd117ffbb23733f907e5568d570449f38d7fc","body_sha256":"6a7da5d8da67da9ae8879a6adfd4c87f3ca534fa46665d0f6ab8d33a0a119fee","article_count":1,"full_text":"Article 23 (Standard of Imposition of Penalty Surcharge) (1) The standard of imposition of penalty surcharge pursuant to Article 17 (1) of the Act shall be as specified in attached Table 3.\n  (2) Where the Fire Commissioner of the National Fire Agency intends to impose penalty surcharge pursuant to Article 17 (1) of the Act, he or she shall notify a person subject to imposition of penalty surcharge of the payment thereof specifying the type of violation and the amount of the penalty surcharge in writing.\n  (3) A person who received a notification pursuant to paragraph (2) shall pay the penalty surcharge to the collecting agency designated by the Fire Commissioner of the National Fire Agency within 30 days from receipt of the notification. <Amended on Dec. 12, 2023>\n  (4) The collecting agency which received penalty surcharge pursuant to paragraph (3) shall issue a receipt to the payer.\n  (5) Where the collecting agency received penalty surcharge pursuant to paragraph (3), it shall notify the Fire Commissioner of the National fire Agency of the fact without delay.","metadata":{"author_checks":["All current held source unit text, source editorial notes, amounts, periods, exceptions and source omission boundaries compared.","Unchanged official English retained only in the recorded exact source/target spans; original row, role, provider, edition, links and receipts remain unchanged.","New affected units are MACHINE_TRANSLATION / UNREVIEWED; source graphics remain linked to actual unchanged assets.","Source unit keys, order and full-text SHA matched the frozen inventory."],"author_method":"Exact verified reuse of existing official English spans plus assistant-authored corrections/new material, with original rows/roles/receipts preserved.","author_self_check_record":{"path":"\\\\100.90.87.105\\YOLLA-D\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1521_KR013050\\translations\\decree\\en.units.parts\\article-23.selfcheck.json","sha256":"046117b83c6ac4e929725a217e83a8603f58c4b750bd83c685d00d1124294bc7"},"body_and_addenda_complete":false,"component_id":"DECREE:kr-013220-287377-ko","component_ids":["DECREE:kr-013220-287377-ko:article-23"],"component_kind":"DECREE","edition_id":"edition-5ab2a19b19eb0df0623363b4150efed54ea5b269bce5b268","english_gap_scope_plan":{"path":"\\\\100.90.87.105\\YOLLA-D\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1521_KR013050\\direct_ingest_v1\\english_gap_scope_plan_v1.json","reason":{"changes":[{"new_text":". <Amended on Dec. 12, 2023>","old_text":": Provided, That the person is unable to pay the penalty surcharge within the prescribed period due to a natural disaster or any other unavoidable cause, he or she shall pay it within seven days from the date such cause ceases to exist.","reason":"Remove the obsolete proviso and preserve the new amendment date; retain the unchanged 30-day payment obligation."}],"reason":"The current source deleted the older force-majeure/seven-day payment proviso on December 12, 2023.","status":"MINIMAL_REPAIR_REQUIRED"},"sha256":"dd2aeb30cb330259f4484b257d488e158de312d85310a6a15ba664da7e6072c7"},"human_or_official_review_claimed":false,"multilingual_schema":"20261018_multilingual_v1","parent_family_i